<title>HUNGARY: Hungary K&amp;H brokerage boosts capital to HUF500mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary K&amp;H brokerage boosts capital to HUF500mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian brokerage K&amp;H Brokerhaz Rt increased its registered capital by 200 million forints to 500 million forints, the company said on Wednesday in the Budapest Stock Exchange's official gazette.</p>
<p>The capital increase was carried out through the issue of new shares, K&amp;H Brokerhaz said.</p>
<p>All the shares were subscribed by Kereskedelmi es Hitelbank Rt (K&amp;H), the 100 percent owner of the brokerage.</p>
<p>K&amp;H, Hungary's third largest bank, is slated for privatisation in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
